  "content_html": "<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<h2 paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{75}\" paraid=\"671359240\">Be Trendy Emerald Shine Shimmer Scrub: Deep Exfoliation &amp; Elegant Glow </h2>\n<p paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{79}\" paraid=\"172018785\">Friday night. You’re heading home after a long, exhausting workday. Your feet are aching, and your skin feels dull from layers of tight clothing and dry air. You step into the bathroom and open a jar of Emerald Shine. Instead of a basic, boring peel, you unlock a visual, magic-like ritual. The emerald-tinted texture gently polishes your skin, sweeping away dead cells, while a subtle shimmer leaves a sophisticated, expensive-looking veil on your body. It’s the ultimate go-to routine when you need more than just a cleanse — it’s an instant skin-toning boost before a romantic dinner, or simply a confidence lift. </p>\n<h2 paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{81}\" paraid=\"302959425\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/svotch-ukr--angl-06.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></h2>\n<h2 paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{81}\" paraid=\"302959425\">Real Benefits: Why Emerald Shine is a rational choice for your skin </h2>\n<p paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{83}\" paraid=\"1005324087\">What sets this shimmer scrub apart in the bath and shower body care category is its balance of effective exfoliation and a radiant visual finish:  </p>\n<ul>\n<li paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{85}\" paraid=\"487695899\">Intense drainage and swelling reduction: The dense texture of the scrub allows for a high-quality massage of problem areas. This stimulates lymphatic drainage, which is critical for restoring skin elasticity on the thighs and abdomen. </li>\n<li paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{87}\" paraid=\"1718918668\">Visual smoothing of the skin microrelief: Micro-particles of \"emerald\" shimmer act as a soft color corrector. They illuminate the skin, visually smoothing out unevenness and making stretch marks or fine blood vessels less noticeable under artificial light. </li>\n<li paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{89}\" paraid=\"1087527717\">Deep detoxification: The scrub effectively removes sebum by-products and urban dust, allowing the pores to breathe. This provides excellent prevention against ingrown hairs after hair removal. </li>\n<li paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{91}\" paraid=\"235724510\">Time-saving body care: After rinsing, the shimmer particles lock onto the skin, eliminating the need for additional highlighters or body oils for shine. Your body looks perfectly groomed right out of the shower. </li>\n</ul>\n<h2 paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{93}\" paraid=\"157900538\"> </h2>\n<h2 paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{93}\" paraid=\"157900538\">Which Be Trendy scrub to choose? </h2>\n<ul>\n<li paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{95}\" paraid=\"1391629763\">If deep cleansing with a focus on a visual wow-effect and radiance is important to you → The Emerald Shine Shimmer Scrub is your ultimate favorite. The emerald shade looks exceptionally stunning on fair and olive skin tones. </li>\n<li paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{99}\" paraid=\"1309317210\">If your priority is aromatherapy and a long-lasting perfume trail → the <a href=\"https://betrendy.space/en/be-trendy-parfium.-skrab-d-t-bergamot-patchouli-300-h/\">Be Trendy Bergamot Patchouli Perfumed Scrub</a> deserves your attention. Its formula is focused more on aromatic impact and nourishment than on a decorative glow. </li>\n<li paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{99}\" paraid=\"1309317210\">If your goal is a \"golden\" tan and a sun-kissed glow → consider the <a href=\"https://betrendy.space/en/shymmer-skrab-golden-glowbanka300-h/\">\"Golden Glow\"</a> version, which delivers a warmer shimmer undertone. </li>\n</ul>\n<p paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{103}\" paraid=\"944425578\">  </p>\n<h2 paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{105}\" paraid=\"83464899\">User Experience: 30-Day Review </h2>\n<p>An analysis of one month of actual product experience leads to the following conclusions: </p>\n<p paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{111}\" paraid=\"1914908875\">After the first week: The tactile condition of the skin visibly improves. It becomes smoother and \"squeaky clean\", but without any feeling of dryness. Unlike gel-based scrubs in tubes, Emerald Shine features a higher concentration of abrasives, allowing you to use less product to achieve the desired result. </p>\n<p paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{113}\" paraid=\"2140757381\">After a month of regular use: When applied 1-2 times a week, rough skin on the elbows and knees is completely smoothed away. Compared to mass-market peels, Be Trendy shimmer is far more long-lasting — it doesn’t flake off onto clothes right after dressing, but stays on until the next shower. Users note that the emerald undertone of the scrub gives the skin an aristocratic freshness. </p>\n<p paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{115}\" paraid=\"1750554205\">  </p>\n<h2 paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{117}\" paraid=\"286010739\">Who It’s For &amp; When to Use It?</h2>\n<p paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{121}\" paraid=\"295358851\"><strong>Perfect if you: </strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{123}\" paraid=\"1339387191\">Love an intense, high-contrast exfoliation (medium to high firmness). </li>\n<li paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{125}\" paraid=\"559878864\">Enjoy a sophisticated, unique \"cool glow\" effect on your skin. </li>\n<li paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{127}\" paraid=\"238113557\">Want to prepare your skin for revealing outfits or a photoshoot. </li>\n<li paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{129}\" paraid=\"97805028\">Prefer a jar format (300 g) for easy scooping during your bath. </li>\n</ul>\n<p paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{131}\" paraid=\"2075592548\"><strong>Not recommended if you: </strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{135}\" paraid=\"293358357\">Have hypersensitive skin or active breakouts (mechanical exfoliation should be avoided). </li>\n<li paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{137}\" paraid=\"1453254440\">Are looking for a completely neutral formula free of pigments and glitter. </li>\n<li paraeid=\"{72adf97a-749e-4148-aa18-c603e3adefdf}{139}\" paraid=\"1326828826\">Want an oil-based scrub (this product focuses on deep cleansing and exfoliation, rather than heavy nourishment). </li>\n</ul>\n </div>\n</div>",
